  "details": "When VRChat is launched, it gets stuck on a white screen and on \"Not Responding\".\n\nIt used to also do that, but after a few tries, it would launch. Now it doesn't launch at all, Live or Open-Beta.\n\nLaunching the .exe (aka offline mode, without EAC) launches without issues, but that's pointless.\n\nLogs are quite empty and don't show anything useful, still included one regardless.\n\nSurface Pro 11th Edition, Snapdragon X Elite.",
